'''Chroma Shark '''is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Gun Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its barrel is silver with a vent screwed into it with three bolts on each side. The forestock is also silver, which connects to the barrel and a portion of the gunstock. Three silver straps are attached below the barrel, and part of the gunstock is colored in black. Color alternating shark fins protrude out from the rear sight, and between the gaps of the forestock on each side, hence the name. The under barrel, the trigger, the handle, and parts of the gunstock also alternate in color.

== Trivia ==
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Shark]], which can be found in the same box.
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it lost a lot of [[value]] due to being [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|duped]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/118281463/Land-Shark-Shooter Land Shark Shooter]. However, its color scheme has been altered from a brown color to a color alternating texture.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

